    - en: "I\u2019m here to buy something!"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Hello, your house is so big!
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019m here to browse your shop. What\u2019s good today?"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Hello! Is there something you need?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Hmm\u2026 what do you want to do?"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Hey, are you here to invite me on an adventure today?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Oh, did you discover something again?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "The wind has brought your message\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Are you ready to face your destiny?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "You know, when I was on the battlefield alone\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Welcome.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Hi, the weather\u2019s nice today, perfect for picking out furniture."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Be gentle with animals.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Customer, what would you like?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Do you want to have a fateful encounter with me?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Hmm, no mistakes today, please.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Good tools make work more efficient.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Are you here to visit my shop? Feel free to browse.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Youth is great! If I could, I\u2019d\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Hey little ones, want to pick something out?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Great! Finally, someone\u2019s here to keep me company."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Duty, honor\u2026 sorry, didn\u2019t see you there."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: If you want to cook, you can ask Daphne.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Ah! Are you joking? This isn\u2019t funny."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "You\u2026 how can you say something like that so easily?"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "If you were a great hero, it\u2019d be amazing\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Sorry, I\u2019m only interested in archaeology\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Let this feeling pass with the wind\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Little one, can you handle me?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: My passion is left on the battlefield.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019m so happy, but I still need to grow up."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Thank you, please buy something in the shop if you can.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Sorry, human hearts lie.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Really? Thanks for the encouragement.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019m not interested in long-term relationships."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "What do you mean? I don\u2019t understand\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019ve already made a vow to my brother. I can\u2019t accept your feelings."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Ah, are you after my wealth?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Oh no, my aging heart can\u2019t withstand your provocation\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "If I were young again\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Sorry, mermaids and humans won\u2019t work out\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Istill want to focus on my career\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Though I wanted to find a father for Daphne, but you\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Sorry, I\u2019m still recovering from an injury. Come back in a while."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019d rather go on an adventure with someone more familiar\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "OK, let\u2019s go on an adventure together."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Hmm, if you insist, I guess I\u2019ll agree."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019ve been waiting for this day."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Ihope we\u2019ll find some clues to ancient ruins this time."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Alright, alright, the breeze told me I should go with you\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "You\u2019d better stay sharp, I don\u2019t want you slowing me down."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Let me show you my brave figure.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Well then, nice to meet you.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Alright, let\u2019s hope we have a good journey."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Stay close to your sister, she\u2019ll protect you."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Hmm, it\u2019s been a long time since I\u2019ve gone out, it feels nice."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Since you\u2019re so sincere, I\u2019ll agree."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Just in time, I also want to practice my skills.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Ishould stretch my legs too.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: So you finally recognize my power.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "If you don\u2019t mind this old body\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Sometimes, I should let Blaise run the shop alone.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019ve actually wanted to go out and see for a while."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Don\u2019t worry, it\u2019s a warrior\u2019s duty to protect the people."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Ishould go out and find new ingredients.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Oh\u2026 what do you want to talk about\u2026 it\u2019s so boring."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Iknew it, you must be here to sneak a peek at my sister.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Have you noticed any unknown ruins during your travels? I wonder what they
        mean.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Ah, your scent is carried by the wind, I send my thoughts to you\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Humans these days are so weak. If it were the ancient strong warriors,
        monsters wouldn\u2019t exist."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "In that war, the kingdom\u2019s army was at a disadvantage, but thanks
        to my performance, we turned the tide and won."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: What kind of food do you like? Ottilia loves grilled seafood.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019m so glad you came to visit me. Will you come again tomorrow?"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Animals are our good partners, they not only produce well but can also
        fight alongside us.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Thank you so much for visiting my shop, I\u2019m happy to help!"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "In this peaceful town, I\u2019ve found a sense of security I haven\u2019t
        felt in a while, I think I\u2019ll stay here longer."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "How can I be as great as them? It\u2019s really troubling."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Imust raise Bradley to be an outstanding man, that\u2019s the meaning
        of my life."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019ve crossed mountains and seas, always chasing wealth, do you understand?"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Sigh, after all these years, Madeleine still hasn\u2019t forgiven me\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Cute little ones, back again to greet me? Thank you so much.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019m so happy to see you, Doris. I really want to go play around with
        you."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Imust become a strong soldier like a general. I need to keep training.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Cooking requires imagination; only then can you infuse deliciousness into
        it.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Agenius like me shouldn\u2019t be trapped in such a small shop."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019ve always been training because I know that one day, fate will
        make me a savior."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: After my research, I conclude that an ancient civilization existed, but
        for some reason disappeared.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: No need to overwork, sometimes stop and enjoy nature.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Magic = 99% talent + 1% effort, so you seem unlikely to become a mage.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "If it weren\u2019t for that incident, I would\u2019ve been the commander
        of the kingdom\u2019s army."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Whether it rains or shines, I think every day is great. What do you think?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Actually, Benedict isn\u2019t as you see him, he has a gentle side too."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Remember to feed the animals every day, don\u2019t let them go hungry."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Talking to you is really relaxing, but I still have work to do, I can\u2019t
        chat anymore."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "I\u2019ve wandered for many years, and yet I still feel so lonely. I don\u2019t
        know where my home is."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Master is a beautiful person, but don\u2019t get any ideas. Master is
        not someone you can handle."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: If you learn how to craft, you can make your own equipment.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: There are many strange races besides humans in this world. Why is it that
        humans occupy the continent?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Did you hear something? Don\u2019t spread rumors, this is something that
        happened when we were young."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "It\u2019s said that one of our mermaids turned her fish tail into legs
        and walked onto land\u2026"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Actually, standing guard alone is quite boring. If someone comes to talk
        to me, I\u2019d be happy."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: If you find any strange ingredients, please make sure to tell me.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "If there\u2019s nothing else, can you leave now?"
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Istill need to manage the shop today, can\u2019t show you my heroic figure,
        come back another day."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "There should be an ancient ruin in this town, but I can\u2019t seem to
        find it."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: This is a magical place. Did you know that there are four seasons scattered
        around the town?
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "The magic potions are still being prepared, they\u2019re not available
        yet."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Be careful, don\u2019t go too far. There are many dangerous monsters outside."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Good kids need a balanced diet. Don\u2019t be picky about vegetables or
        meat."
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: If you ever start a family, you must buy furniture here.
