    - en: Dear {0},
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Lately, I've been feeling more and more tired, and I don't have much time
        left. I don't want to be a frail old man dying in bed, so before death comes
        for me, I've decided to embark on a journey around the world.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: The only thing I care about in this world is {0}. My home is in the town,
        and I don't want it to be left in ruin. I hope you'll inherit it. The people
        in the town are kind, and they'll help you if you face any difficulties.
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: Well, it's time for me to go. Wish me luck.
      jp: 
