    - en: Bulletin
      jp: 
      ko: 
    - en: "Dear friends,\nHello everyone! I am an independent game developer, and
        this game was created entirely by me during my spare time while balancing
        my full-time job. Due to limited availability, some features may feel rushed\u2014thank
        you for your understanding! I will continue developing the game, fixing bugs,
        improving the experience, and adding unfinished features.\n\nIf you have
        any ideas or feedback, please email me at shanflyer@qq.com. I read every
        message carefully. If your suggestions are adopted, I will add your name
        to the Contributors list. Let\u2019s make this game our game together!\n\nIf
        you\u2019d like to support my work, your encouragement will fuel my efforts
        to achieve our shared vision. Thank you!"
      jp: 
      ko: 
